# Development-only trees, deliberately kept out of the published repository:
#   benchmark/     the 33-dataset MatrixDepot harness + its vendored copy of the
#                  original fixed-composite method and raw result logs
#   filter_design/ the offline filter-bank generator (its output,
#                  include/psd_projection/filter_bank.h, IS committed)
#   docs/          technical + benchmark reports (PDF and LaTeX sources)
# They live in the working tree but are not tracked.  Remove the corresponding
# line to publish one of them.
benchmark/
filter_design/
docs/
